    {
      "id": "claim_4d96a3116cef490d98e70b6100e1804d",
      "statement": "At an optimizer boundary the trainer updates EMA from the post-step live model, and a later periodic checkpoint captures the resulting EMA state; EMA and scheduler updates occur only at optimizer boundaries.",
