    {
      "id": "claim_af232d2c27e3406f843b9d924948bfe3",
      "statement": "Periodic checkpoints are named `<model_filename>_step_<step>.pt`; when retention is enabled, the trainer numerically sorts matching step files and deletes all but the newest `keep_last_n_checkpoints`, while best and final artifacts are outside that cleanup pattern.",
