    {
      "id": "claim_71c89aa2d28341fe9c7f7190fd58d6f4",
      "statement": "With asynchronous checkpointing, periodic `torch.save` runs in a daemon thread named `ckpt-save-<step>` and returns that thread; at shutdown the trainer joins only the most recently returned thread before final persistence.",
