    {
      "id": "claim_c5298f0556d04eea864eede083ec5cee",
      "statement": "Final persistence is synchronous and writes two distinct files: `<model_filename>_final_model_full.pt` containing the full checkpoint dictionary and `<model_filename>_final_model_weights.pt` containing only `model.state_dict()`; it does not create a normal `_step_<max_steps>.pt` file.",
